{"version":1,"content":"<p>政府早前公開宏福苑大火獨立委員會報告。</p><p>民政及青年事務局長麥美娟今日（31日）出席活動後見傳媒表示，作為問責團隊一員，她衷心向受影響災民和社會道歉，未來會按特首指示，緊守崗位及做好制度改革，做好以結果為目標的施政理念。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.924734+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T10:07:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.871918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.050727+00:00","content_hash":"f78d38f75f24dc36ccc75179042616b87bd505737b1e4618df3e763d06a22137","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}